 {"key":"transfer_targets","value":{"team": {"label": "RSG Team", "phone": ""}, "joseph": {"label": "Joseph Oday", "phone": ""}},"description":"Numbers used for live transfers; empty phone = transfers unavailable, AI falls back to callbacks","updated_at":"2026-07-17T05:51:18.997994+00:00","updated_by":null}, 
